16:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed","children":"Geng Metal individuals are strong-willed, direct, and have a deep sense of justice and chivalry. They love challenges and are polished through hardship, like crude iron forged into a legendary sword. They are intensely loyal to friends, direct in speech, and highly decisive. However, they can be overly aggressive, blunt, and insensitive to others' feelings."}]
